<title>USA: Consolidated Graphics to split stock 2-for1.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Graphics to split stock 2-for1.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Graphics Inc said it will split its common stock two-for-one.</p>
<p>The split will be in the form of a stock dividend to be distributed on January 10 to shareholders of record on December 31.</p>
<p>The company now has 6,154,840 shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
